OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785442291
OL,3,CFrench student fined in Singapore
OL,4,Cafter straw-licking post goes viral
OL,6,FA French student has been fined after
OL,7,Fpleading guilty to a public nuisance
OL,8,Foffence in Singapore for filming
OL,9,Fhimself licking a straw from an orange
OL,10,Fjuice vending machine before putting
OL,11,Fit back.
OL,13,FDidier Gaspard Owen Maximilien, 19,
OL,14,Fwas fined 600 Singapore dollars (about
OL,15,F#348) after admitting that he licked
OL,16,Fthe straw while filming the act for
OL,17,Fhis social media followers.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
