OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785442291
OL,3,CFrench student fined in Singapore
OL,4,Cafter straw-licking post goes viral
OL,6,FThe incident took place at a shopping
OL,7,Fcentre in March. He was charged the
OL,8,Ffollowing month after the video spread
OL,9,Fwidely online.
OL,11,FA second charge of mischief was taken
OL,12,Finto consideration during sentencing.
OL,14,FThe court imposed a fine and did not
OL,15,Forder a community-based sentence after
OL,16,Fconsidering mitigating factors.
OL,18,FThe public nuisance offence carries a
OL,19,Fmaximum penalty of three months'
OL,20,Fimprisonment.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785442291
OL,3,CFrench student fined in Singapore
OL,4,Cafter straw-licking post goes viral
OL,6,FProsecutors had sought the maximum
OL,7,Ffine of 2,000 Singapore dollars
OL,8,F(around #1,161), arguing the stunt was
OL,9,Fstaged for social media and risked
OL,10,Fdamaging public confidence in the
OL,11,Fhygiene of a widely used vending
OL,12,Fmachine.
OL,14,FThey acknowledged, however, that
OL,15,FMaximilien retrieved the straw
OL,16,Fhimself, no member of the public used
OL,17,Fit, there was no evidence of harm, and
OL,18,Fthat he was young and had pleaded
OL,19,Fguilty at the earliest opportunity.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785442291
OL,3,CFrench student fined in Singapore
OL,4,Cafter straw-licking post goes viral
OL,6,FMaximilien is a business student in
OL,7,FSingapore, although prosecutors told
OL,8,Fthe court he is due to spend September
OL,9,Fto December in France as part of his
OL,10,Fstudies.
OL,12,FProsecutors said Singapore's
OL,13,Fimmigration authorities would decide
OL,14,Fwhether Maximilien could retain his
OL,15,Fstudent pass after considering all
OL,16,Frelevant factors.
OL,18,FDefence lawyer Kalidass Murugayan said
OL,19,Fthe student had been living in
OL,20,FSingapore without family support and
OL,21,Fwas deeply remorseful for his actions.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785442291
OL,3,CFrench student fined in Singapore
OL,4,Cafter straw-licking post goes viral
OL,6,FHe told the court the video was a
OL,7,Fstunt intended for social media and
OL,8,Fthat Maximilien had later removed the
OL,9,Fcontaminated straw to use for his own
OL,10,Fdrink, meaning it was never intended
OL,11,Fto be used by anyone else.
OL,13,F"He is truly sorry for having caused
OL,14,Fall this trouble," Murugayan said,
OL,15,Fadding that Maximilien's parents would
OL,16,Fensure he paid the fine himself.
OL,18,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,19,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,20,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,21,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
