CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785442291
OL,3,CFrench student fined in Singapore
OL,4,Cafter straw-licking post goes viral
OL,6,FThe student left court without
OL,7,Fspeaking to reporters.
OL,9,FIJooz, the company that operates the
OL,10,Forange juice vending machine, filed a
OL,11,Fpolice report over the incident and
OL,12,Fsanitised the dispenser, replacing all
OL,13,F500 straws inside the machine.
OL,15,FThe company said it would upgrade its
OL,16,Fmachines with measures including
OL,17,Findividually wrapped straws and
OL,18,Fcompartments that unlock only after a
OL,19,Fpurchase has been completed.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
