OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785442291
OL,3,CFrench student fined in Singapore
OL,4,Cafter straw-licking post goes viral
OL,6,FSingapore, a densely populated city-
OL,7,Fstate, has strict laws governing
OL,8,Fpublic behaviour and cleanliness, with
OL,9,Ftough penalties for offences such as
OL,10,Flittering and vandalism.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/7
